From 56cb73c496ce1b81a2f91f96203844edb4749558 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vair <79313360+nicolasvair@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 15:44:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] VST3: retire le jassert factory != nullptr
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Plante en Debug quand un VST3 ne fournit pas de factory (plugin cassé
ou mismatch 32/64-bit). La factory nulle est déjà gérée par l'appelant.

Report du patch local Objekat sur JUCE 37c894f (pin de tracktion develop) :
le code a déménagé de juce_audio_processors/format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormat.cpp
vers juce_audio_processors_headless/format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormatImpl.h.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormatImpl.h               | 7 +++----
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/modules/juce_audio_processors_headless/format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormatImpl.h b/modules/juce_audio_processors_headless/format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormatImpl.h
index feeb930012..0e8738375a 100644
--- a/modules/juce_audio_processors_headless/format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormatImpl.h
+++ b/modules/juce_audio_processors_headless/format_types/juce_VST3PluginFormatImpl.h
@@ -1098,10 +1098,9 @@ struct DLLHandle
             if (auto* proc = (GetFactoryProc) getFunction (factoryFnName))
                 factory = VSTComSmartPtr (proc(), IncrementRef::no);
 
-        // The plugin NEEDS to provide a factory to be able to be called a VST3!
-        // Most likely you are trying to load a 32-bit VST3 from a 64-bit host
-        // or vice versa.
-        jassert (factory != nullptr);
+        // N.B. Patch local Objekat : le jassert (factory != nullptr) d'origine plante en
+        // Debug quand un VST3 ne fournit pas de factory (plugin cassé ou mismatch 32/64-bit).
+        // La factory nulle est déjà gérée par l'appelant.
         return factory;
     }
 
